     {
      "text": "41-year-old male presenting with excessive thirst and frequent urination for 4 months. Character: passing urine many times, also at night; radiation: n/a; aggravated by sweet food; relieved by nothing. Severity 8/10. Associated: tiredness, weight loss, blurred vision. PMH: Type 2 diabetes for 7 years. Drugs: Metformin 500 mg. Allergy: no known allergies. Family: heart disease. Personal: chews tobacco. Triage: URGENT."
